OL,3,GNEWSAMan pronounced dead after beach
OL,4,Aemergency
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died after emergency services
OL,7,Fwere called to Bournemouth beach,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FDorset Police said officers, South
OL,11,FWestern Ambulance Service paramedics
OL,12,Fand coastguard rescue teams were called
OL,13,Fto Durley Chine Beach at about 16:15
OL,14,FBST on Sunday.
OL,16,FThe man was pronounced dead shortly
OL,17,Fafterwards. His death is not being
OL,18,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,20,F"Our thoughts are with the man's family
OL,21,Fand friends at this very difficult
OL,22,Ftime," a force spokesperson said.
